\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Performance--CV island plots for the architecture comparison using 50\% density contours. Each panel shows mean performance against hyperparameter CV for one task-agnostic metric. Points mark condition centers; the starred island marks the ambiguous-edge \textit  {C.\ elegans} connectome. The colormap encodes the fraction of edges with negative weights: blue denotes 0\%, purple denotes the ambiguous-edge connectome fraction (the ``CE'' tick, approximately 24.25\%), and yellow denotes 50\%. Exact legend-label mappings, abbreviations, and full definitions for all architectures shown here are provided in Appendix~\ref {supp:architectures}.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{2}{7}{Performance--CV island plots for the architecture comparison using 50\% density contours. Each panel shows mean performance against hyperparameter CV for one task-agnostic metric. Points mark condition centers; the starred island marks the ambiguous-edge \textit {C.\ elegans} connectome. The colormap encodes the fraction of edges with negative weights: blue denotes 0\%, purple denotes the ambiguous-edge connectome fraction (the ``CE'' tick, approximately 24.25\%), and yellow denotes 50\%. Exact legend-label mappings, abbreviations, and full definitions for all architectures shown here are provided in Appendix~\ref {supp:architectures}}{figure.2}{}}
